<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 144 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 144 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet to February 7 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to January 31  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 61,865	 62,009</p>
<p> Money market intervention    14,823	 14,277</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,265	  2,265</p>
<p> Total assets		     87,753	 87,308</p>
<p>In the previous week to January 31 reserves fell by 1.67 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
